- Never change existing JSX structure, Tailwind classes, or component layout without being explicitly asked to.
- When wiring real data into a page, only replace the data source (mock array → query/fetch call). Do not touch the rendering/markup.
- Always show a diff/summary of changed files before applying, and wait for confirmation on anything touching files under app/admin/.
- Do not delete or rewrite existing files unless explicitly told to — prefer adding new files.
